  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From Einstein&#39;s photoelectric equation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mi>&#957;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>&#957;</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#981;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#957;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>Putting the value in equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>hv</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#981;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;Work function <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#957;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6.63</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1.6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1.66</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>"
  }
